# ============================================================================
#  项目003 — 邮箱聚合平台（Go 主干 + React 前端 + Electron/鸿蒙/移动端）忽略规则
#
#  ⚠️ 曾误入库 23445 个文件，主要是 .gopath / .gocache 两处 Go 模块与构建缓存
#     （含 42 MB 的 vmlinux 测试数据、多个 37 MB 的依赖 zip、若干 .exe 测试件）。
#     本文件必须同时覆盖【顶层】与【email-aggregator-go/ 内嵌套】两份同名缓存。
# ============================================================================

# ===== 依赖 =====
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# ===== Go 模块缓存与构建缓存（严禁入库）=====
.gopath/
.gocache/
**/.gopath/
**/.gocache/
**/vendor/
bin/
**/bin/*.exe
**/bin/*.exe~

# ===== 环境与部署凭据（绝不入库）=====
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
**/.env
**/.env.production
**/.env.keycloak
**/.env.keycloak-prod
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.example
.edgeone/
.wrangler/

# ===== 编译产物与二进制（严禁入库）=====
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.test
*.out
dist/
build/
out/
*.appimage
*.AppImage
*.dmg
*.deb
*.msix
*.hap
*.tsbuildinfo

# ===== 前端与子平台构建产物 =====
email-aggregator-web/dist/
platforms/desktop/build/
platforms/desktop/release/
platforms/desktop/dist/
platforms/desktop/node_modules/
platforms/mobile/build/
platforms/mobile/dist/
platforms/mobile/node_modules/
platforms/harmony/build/
platforms/harmony/.preview/
platforms/harmony/oh_modules/
platforms/harmony/**/build/

# ===== 日志、CI 缓存与临时文件 =====
*.log
.ci-logs/
.tmp_q/
.tmp_att/
shots/
.cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

# ===== 系统与编辑器临时文件 =====
